OL,5,G1000 Nightmare Tenants, Slum Landlords
OL,6,     FJohn wants to turn a former
OL,7,     FBlackpool hotel into much-needed
OL,8,     Fbedsits, but finds a severely
OL,9,     Fneglected house and a drug den.
OL,10,     FChris's tenants refuse to admit
OL,11,     Fthey owe him any money.
OL,12,G1100 Traffic Cops
OL,13,     FPC Jackson's instincts lead him on
OL,14,     Fa high-speed chase. A car with
OL,15,     Ffalse number plates makes a hasty
OL,16,     Fgetaway.
OL,17,G1200 Traffic Cops
OL,18,     FA driver disastrously misjudges an
OL,19,     Fovertaking manoeuvre, while
OL,20,     Fanother falls asleep at the wheel
OL,21,     Fon the M1 motorway.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
