OL,8,     FSpecialist ANPR crime unit target
OL,9,     Fdrug dealers coming into the
OL,10,     Fcounty from other areas.
OL,11,G1400 Police Interceptors
OL,12,     FObservational documentary series.
OL,13,     FThe high-speed pursuit specialists
OL,14,     Fof Cumbria tackle a runaway
OL,15,     Fknifeman, an overturned trailer
OL,16,     Ffull of cows and a ruptured gas
OL,17,     Fmain.
OL,18,G1500 Police Interceptors
OL,19,     FDuncan receives a shock when a
OL,20,     Fcyclist who has been crushed and
OL,21,     Ftrapped under a car turns out to
OL,22,     Fbe someone he knows.
