OL,5,G1830 Home and Away
OL,6,     FDana and Sonny are at odds. Cash
OL,7,     Fattempts a rescue. Levi's life is
OL,8,     Fon the edge.
OL,9,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,10,     FIrene arrives at Hall Green
OL,11,     FHealth, Birmingham, with a nasty
OL,12,     Ffoot infection. Farhan sees Dr
OL,13,     FWard as he is struggling with a
OL,14,     Ftight chest and feelings of
OL,15,     Fsuffocation in enclosed spaces.
OL,16,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,17,     FThe pace at Barnsley Casualty is
OL,18,     Frelentless; other hospitals in the
OL,19,     Farea are full and as a result,
OL,20,     Fambulances are being diverted to
OL,21,     FBarnsley.
